cases.json in this directory is garrytan/gbrain's
test/fixtures/memory-verbs/cases.json at commit
fd22a75d136df59bd7d3d43f6ccd6b9ef823037a, vendored byte for byte
(sha256 b0d8a2fd8e77c48eb01571891b49e0c9898333d0c8e303db9fba822ea028bbd2).
It is the conformance suite of MEMORY_VERBS v1, which the memory verbs of this
brain (contract brain-verbs.v1) follow. gbrain itself is never installed or
run: tests/test_memory_verbs_conformance.py is a small runner of our own, and it
only ever targets a temporary corpus.

